@startuml

title ComponentHub - Browse Components by Category

actor User
participant "Browse page\n(app.js)" as UI
participant "Catalogue client\n(catalogue.js)" as Client

User -> UI: Open Browse page
UI -> Client: init()
Client --> UI: Cached categories and components
UI -> UI: Resolve selected category
UI -> UI: Find category subtree recursively
UI -> UI: Filter cached components by category IDs
UI -> User: Display category tree and component cards

User -> UI: Select category or component
alt Select category
  UI -> UI: Update category query parameter
  UI -> User: Display matching component cards
else Select component
  UI -> User: Navigate to component details
end
@enduml
